/**
 * Skill Experiment — Copilot Shell Exploration
 *
 * Cloned from the FCC Flow as a fresh sandbox for iterating on skill-oriented
 * ideas without disturbing the original. Inherits the full FCC shape (sources
 * menu, inline settings modal, three-state sync, recency-ordered connected
 * list) and starts with identical behavior; diverge as the experiment requires.
 *
 * Usage:  npx tsx preview/src/skillExperiment.ts
 * Output: preview/dist/skillExperiment.html
 */

